Enumeration EntryGradeLevelReason
    documentation 'The primary reason as to why a staff member determined that a student should be 
    'promoted or not (or be demoted) at the end of a given school term.
    item Promotion - Accelerated promotion
    item Promotion - Continuous promotion
    item Promotion - Probationary promotion
    item Promotion - Regular promotion
    item Promotion - Variable progress
    item Promotion - Other
    item Nonpromotion - Failed to meet testing requirements
    item Nonpromotion - Illness
    item Nonpromotion - Immaturity
    item Nonpromotion - Inadequate performance
    item Nonpromotion - Insufficient credits
    item Nonpromotion - Prolonged absence
    item Nonpromotion - Other

